  editorial_hook_en='The Brunei Gallery at SOAS presents changing exhibitions of historic and contemporary art from Asia, Africa and the Middle East.', editorial_hook_it='La Galleria Brunei di SOAS presenta mutevoli mostre di arte storica e contemporanea provenienti da Asia, Africa e Medio Oriente.',
