  official_url='https://www.epsom-ewell.gov.uk/residents/venues-sport-and-leisure-facilities/bourne-hall-museum', access_notes_en='Opening hours and exhibition schedules can change. Check the official venue site before travelling, especially between temporary shows or for event-day restrictions.', access_notes_it='Orari e calendario delle mostre possono cambiare. Controlla il sito ufficiale prima di partire, soprattutto tra mostre temporanee o in giornate con eventi.',
