UPDATE places SET description_en='Goldsmiths Centre for Contemporary Art occupies the converted boiler houses of the former Laurie Grove Baths. Assemble’s adaptation preserves industrial brickwork and tanks while creating galleries for ambitious free exhibitions by emerging and established international artists linked to Goldsmiths’ research culture.', description_it='Goldsmiths Centre for Contemporary Art occupa le case di caldaie convertite dell''ex Laurie Grove Baths. L’adattamento di Assemble conserva mattoni industriali e carri armati, creando gallerie per ambiziose mostre gratuite di artisti internazionali emergenti e affermati legati alla cultura della ricerca Goldsmiths.',
