UPDATE places SET description_en='Amersham Museum at 49 and 51 High Street is a small local museum based in Amersham, Buckinghamshire, England. It is located on the High Street in Old Amersham. == History == The museum is partly located in a 15th-century half-timbered house, listed Grade II on the National Heritage List for England, with a herb garden to the rear, and covers local history.', description_it='Amersham Museum a 49 e 51 High Street è un piccolo museo locale con sede ad Amersham, Buckinghamshire, Inghilterra. Si trova sulla High Street in Old Amersham. == Storia == Il museo si trova in parte in una casa semi-arredata del XV secolo, classificata Grade II nella Lista del Patrimonio Nazionale per l''Inghilterra, con un giardino di erba al posteriore, e copre la storia locale.',
