UPDATE places SET description_en='The Centre for British Photography is an independent space devoted to photography made in Britain. Exhibitions draw on the Hyman Collection and invited artists to reassess documentary, portrait and experimental traditions, pairing established names with overlooked or emerging photographers.', description_it='Il Centre for British Photography è uno spazio indipendente dedicato alla fotografia in Gran Bretagna. Le mostre disegnano sulla Hyman Collection e invitano gli artisti a rivalutare le tradizioni documentarie, ritrattistiche e sperimentali, abbinando nomi consolidati con fotografi trascurati o emergenti.',
