UPDATE places SET description_en='The Royal London Hospital Museum preserves the medical and social history of the Whitechapel hospital founded in the eighteenth century. Displays include nursing and surgical material, hospital archives and stories associated with Joseph Merrick and Edith Cavell; access is limited and current arrangements should be confirmed.', description_it='Il Royal London Hospital Museum conserva la storia medica e sociale dell''ospedale Whitechapel fondato nel XVIII secolo. I display includono materiale di allattamento e chirurgia, archivi ospedalieri e storie associate a Joseph Merrick e Edith Cavell; l''accesso è limitato e le disposizioni attuali dovrebbero essere confermate.',
