UPDATE places SET description_en='Gunnersbury Park Museum fills the former Rothschild mansion with galleries on Ealing and Hounslow. Local archaeology, industry, fashion and domestic objects sit alongside restored historic rooms, while the surrounding park retains ornamental buildings and landscapes from the estate.', description_it='Gunnersbury Park Museum riempie l''ex palazzo Rothschild con gallerie su Ealing e Hounslow. Archeologia locale, industria, moda e oggetti domestici siedono accanto a sale storiche restaurate, mentre il parco circostante conserva edifici ornamentali e paesaggi della tenuta.',
