UPDATE places SET description_en='Quentin Blake Centre for Illustration (formerly House of Illustration) is the only public arts organisation in the UK dedicated to illustration. It was founded by Quentin Blake in 2002 and is based in London, England. From 2014 to 2020, it was located at 2 Granary Square in the London Borough of Camden and called House of Illustration.', description_it='Quentin Blake Centre for Illustration (ex House of Illustration) è l''unica organizzazione di arti pubbliche nel Regno Unito dedicata all''illustrazione. È stata fondata da Quentin Blake nel 2002 e ha sede a Londra, Inghilterra. Dal 2014 al 2020, si trova a 2 Granary Square nel London Borough di Camden e si chiama House of Illustration.',
