UPDATE places SET description_en='The Ragged School Museum is a museum in the London Borough of Tower Hamlets. The museum was opened in 1990 in the premises of the former Dr Barnardo''s Copperfield Road Ragged School. The school opened in 1877 to serve the children of Mile End with a basic education. It was the largest of its kind at the time.', description_it='Il Ragged School Museum è un museo del London Borough of Tower Hamlets. Il museo è stato aperto nel 1990 nei locali dell''ex Dr Barnardo Copperfield Road Ragged School. La scuola si aprì nel 1877 per servire i bambini di Mile End con una formazione di base. Era il più grande del suo genere all''epoca.',
