  editorial_hook_en='Isokon Gallery occupies the former garage of the landmark 1934 Isokon Building in Hampstead.', editorial_hook_it='Isokon Gallery occupa l''ex garage del punto di riferimento 1934 Isokon Building a Hampstead.',
